# QA Dashboard

Enterprise-oriented QA test analytics built with Streamlit, Pandas, and Plotly. The dashboard
ships with a deterministic 1,000-record sample dataset at
`data/raw/qa_dashboard_master_1000_records.csv`.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

To regenerate the sample data, run `python -m qa_dashboard.sample_data` after installation. Set
`QA_DASHBOARD_DATA` to load a different CSV with the same schema.

## Run

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```
